  "description": "Shibuyo is a traditional Japanese brush used for calligraphy and painting. It has soft, flexible bristles that allow for smooth, expressive strokes. Often made from animal hair, it is used to create beautiful, flowing characters or artwork with ink. Shibuyo brushes come in various sizes, each designed for different types of writing or painting.",
